#op: compile
A version file has at most three fields: schema, ForwardLens and BackwardLens.
Anything else is usually a typo; when the name is close to one of the three,
the help names it.
-- ship/history/0.0.thema --
Schema: {
	a: string
}
-- ship/history/1.0.thema --
scehma: {
	a: string
	b: int
}

ForwardLens: {
	v0_0: _
	v1_0: {
		b: 1
	}
}
-- ship/tip.thema --
scehma: {
	a: string
	b: int
}
